From b71519c3804e18b56a4b2f6953a24f732d53ae9f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: huangmenghong <huangmenghong@contributor>


Date: Thu, 21 Aug 2025 17:57:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] USERSTORY backport sqlfilter feature from MySQL 930

Issue:
------
MySQL on DStore doesn't support SQL filter currently which is the necessary feature for commercial use. We merge the MySQL's SQL filter feature into MySQL on DStore.

Solution:
------
SQL filter rules are stored in system table mysql.rds_sql_filter_rules and managed by five native procedures:
  [1] Adding table mysql.rds_sql_filter_rules which is used to save sql filter rules.
  [2] Adding call dbms_sqlfilter.add_sql_filter(type, max_concurrency, key_str, node_id);
      It is used to add one sql filter rule to table and memory.
  [3] Adding call dbms_sqlfilter.delete_sql_filter(id);
      It is used to delete one sql filter rule from table and memory.
  [4] Adding call dbms_sqlfilter.update_sql_filter(item_id, type, max_concurrency, key_str, node_id);
      It is used to update one sql filter rule to table and memory.
  [5] Adding call dbms_sqlfilter.show_sql_filter();
      It is used to show all sql filter rules from memory.
  [6] Adding call dbms_sqlfilter.flush_sql_filter();
      It is used to flush all sql filter rules form table to memory.

Variables:
------
  [1] rds_sqlfilter_control :
      indicates whether the sql filter is enabled.
      Default value: OFF

  [2] rds_sqlfilter_affect_admin_user :
      indicates whether sql filter affects admin user(root).
      Default value: ON

  [3] rds_sqlfilter_case_sensitive :
      indicates whether comparisons of sql filter keys are   case-sensitive.
      Default value: OFF

  [4] rds_sqlfilter_sys_table_control :
      indicates whether sql filter control the traffic of system table.
      Default value: OFF

  [5] rds_sqlfilter_rules_max_count :
      The maximum number for sql filter rules that is allowed to be added.
      Default value: 100
      Range: [1, 1500]
  [6] rds_node_id :
      Uniquely identifies a node which is set by agent.
      Default value: ""
